# Scoped ignore for the API image. See Dockerfile header: the image is built from
# the repository root, and BuildKit uses the co-located Dockerfile.dockerignore
# (identical content) for that build. This file documents the same exclusions.

# Source control / metadata
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/.gitattributes

# .NET build output and test results
**/bin
**/obj
**/artifacts
**/TestResults
**/*.trx
**/*.coverage

# Frontend dependencies and build output (not part of the API image)
apps/web/node_modules
apps/web/dist
apps/web/.angular
apps/web/coverage
**/node_modules

# IDE / editor state
**/.vs
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/*.user

# Local secrets / environment (never copy into image layers)
**/*.env
**/.env.*
**/secrets.json
**/*.pfx

# Docs / infra / pipelines / scripts are not needed to build the image
**/*.md
infra/
pipelines/
scripts/
